id: 12
hanzi: 诗
pinyin: shī
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: poem; poetry; verse; poetic sentiment
  es: poema; poesía; verso; sentimiento poético

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | poetry; a poem; literary composition characterized by rhythm and vivid imagery | poema; poesía; composición literaria caracterizada por el ritmo y la emoción lírica | 写一首诗 (write a poem)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 面对趵突泉奔腾喷涌的壮丽奇观，古往今来的文人留下了无数脍炙人口的赞美诗篇。 | Miànduì Bàotūquán bēnténg pēnyǒng de zhuànglì qíguān, gǔwǎngjīnlái de wénrén liúxià le wúshù kuàizhìrénkǒu de zànměi shīpiān. | Confronted with the magnificent spectacle of Baotu Spring surging forth, literati through the ages left behind countless celebrated poems of praise. | Ante el prodigioso e impetuoso borbotar del manantial Baotu, literatos de todas las épocas compusieron innumerables poemas célebres de alabanza.
  #2 | 在现代文学创作研讨会上，青年学者深入探讨了古代山水诗在当代生态文明理念中的美学价值。 | Zài xiàndài wénxué chuàngzuò yántǎohuì shàng, qīngnián xuézhě shēnrù tàntǎo le gǔdài shānshuǐ shī zài dāngdài shēngtài wénmíng lǐniàn zhōng de měixué jiàzhí. | At the contemporary literature symposium, young scholars explored the aesthetic value of classical landscape poetry within modern ecological values. | En el simposio literario contemporáneo, jóvenes investigadores debatieron el valor estético de la poesía paisajística clásica en la conciencia ecológica actual.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  一首诗 | a poem
  写诗 | compose poetry; write a poem
